<https://lovamap.com/ontology#paper/10.1021-mp200171d> a bibo:AcademicArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Gojgini et al., 2011 — HA Hydrogel Gene Transfer" ;
    dc:title "Utilizing Cell–Matrix Interactions To Modulate Gene Transfer to Stem Cells Inside Hyaluronic Acid Hydrogels" ;
