                       <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/tokatlian-talar>
                       <https://lovamap.com/ontology#author/segura-tatiana> ) ;
    dc:bibliographicCitation "Gojgini et al., 2011" ;
    lova:focusMaterial "MMP-degradable hyaluronic acid (HA) hydrogel scaffolds loaded with DNA/PEI polyplexes for 3D stem cell gene transfer" .

